# MISH-OS UNIVERSAL AGENT RULES v2.0
# Copy this to every project root as `.clauderules`

## SESSION START (MANDATORY - RUN BEFORE ANY CODE)

1. READ this file + ./Sessions/[latest].md
2. Verify Git identity: mvallautomations / mvallarautomates@gmail.com
3. Run: git pull
4. If project needs .env: unlock Bitwarden → Get-Secrets.ps1
5. ANNOUNCE: Environment, branch, last handoff, status

## NAMING (ENFORCED)

- Folders: kebab-case (`handlit-agent-dashboard`)
- PowerShell: PascalCase.ps1 (`Get-Secrets.ps1`)
- Bash: kebab-case.sh (`inject-secrets.sh`)
- Docs: UPPERCASE.md (`README.md`) or kebab-case.md (guides)
- Assets: name_YYYYMMDD_version.ext (`logo_20260402_v2.svg`)
- Dates: ISO 8601 (`2026-04-02`)
- FORBIDDEN: spaces, parentheses, special chars

## GIT WORKFLOW (MANDATORY)

- Commit often: `git add . && git commit -m "[type]: [what]"`
- Push before switching tools: `git push`
- NEVER force push without permission
- Types: feat, fix, chore, docs, refactor, style, test, session

## SECRETS (MANDATORY)

- NEVER hardcode secrets
- Use Bitwarden auto-injection: `Get-Secrets.ps1 -Project [name] -Environment dev`
- Naming: `[PROJECT]_[ENV]_[KEY]` (e.g., `HANDLIT_DEV_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`)
- NEVER commit .env (only .env.template)

## SESSION END (MANDATORY - RUN BEFORE CLOSING TOOL)

1. git add . && git commit -m "session: [summary]" && git push
2. Generate-Handoff.ps1 → ./Sessions/YYYY-MM-DD_HH-MM_tool.md
3. bw lock
4. ANNOUNCE: Commits pushed, handoff created, safe to close

## PROJECT STRUCTURE (REQUIRED)

```
project-name/
├── .clauderules
├── .gitignore
├── .env.template
├── README.md
├── CHANGELOG.md
├── Sessions/
├── docs/
├── src/
├── scripts/
├── assets/
└── tests/
```

## CONTINUATION (NEXT AGENT)

Next agent MUST:
1. Read .clauderules
2. Read ./Sessions/[latest].md
3. Run session start protocol
4. Announce what you learned from handoff

## VALIDATION CHECKLIST

```
[ ] Naming conventions followed
[ ] No secrets in code
[ ] Git identity correct
[ ] Changes committed
[ ] Remote synced (git push)
[ ] Handoff log created
[ ] Bitwarden locked
```

**Full docs:** mish-git-sync-protocol, mish-ops-secrets, mish-naming-standard
